{
    "word": "epicure",
    "lang_code": "en",
    "source_file_to_entries": {
        "raw-wiktextract-data.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "9c82c3f0-94e4-37bf-ab10-4e2040d32c0e",
                "word": "epicure",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "1abc1ec6-bbd4-41be-a0e3-811e38915a4d",
                        "entry_id": "9c82c3f0-94e4-37bf-ab10-4e2040d32c0e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "epicures"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                        "entry_id": "9c82c3f0-94e4-37bf-ab10-4e2040d32c0e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who takes particular pleasure in fine food and drink."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "87bc7e67-14a9-4525-ac69-c51c7638b1f7",
                                "sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                                "text": "If there bee any lasie fellow, any that cannot away with worke, any that would wallow in pleasures, hee is hastie to be priested. And when hee is made one, and has gotten a benefice, he consorts with his neighbour priests, who are altogether given to pleasures; and then both hee, and they, live, not like Christians, but like epicures; drinking, eating, feasting, and revelling, till the cow come home, as the saying is."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "06641bac-40f5-4974-9799-836fc79d9c18",
                                "sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                                "text": "But, without preaching, the truth may surely be borne in mind, that the bustle, and triumph, and laughter, and gaiety which Vanity Fair exhibits in public, do not always pursue the performer into private life, and that the most dreary depression of spirits and dismal repentances sometimes overcome him. Recollection of the best ordained banquets will scarcely cheer sick epicures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9ec81144-a328-44f0-b83e-19a15a417fb2",
                                "sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                                "text": "The refreshments which the servants had prepared were now put on the table, and an epicure would perhaps have enjoyed them with additonal zest, from the contrast which such fare afforded to the miserable cabin in which it was served up."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "00d780c6-f55d-4f4a-aee5-4b67fc203c8e",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c82c3f0-94e4-37bf-ab10-4e2040d32c0e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person who takes particular pleasure in fine food and drink",
                        "target_lang_word": "Genießer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Genießer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2bf4a894-f0f3-3123-ab4b-e58ca43f2b60",
                                        "entry_id": "d377a729-e110-38b0-91be-d61dd191faa4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Person, die zu genießen weiß; jemand, der es liebt, bestimmte Dinge zu genießen (wie etwa gutes Essen)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "45f9ebc7-02ab-41f5-a7f9-3880456cada6",
                                                "sense_id": "2bf4a894-f0f3-3123-ab4b-e58ca43f2b60",
                                                "text": "„Egal ob Oster- oder Adventsbackwerk, ob Obst-, Geburtstagskuchen oder Mehlspeisen – jeder Genießer wird etwas Gutes finden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be972a79-8e95-4622-8a22-5bff130356a4",
                                                "sense_id": "2bf4a894-f0f3-3123-ab4b-e58ca43f2b60",
                                                "text": "„Ein Genießer kann nicht verzichten – zumindest, wenn das, was geboten wird, erlesen, lecker und besonders ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0f5dc4d-88bf-4145-bcf7-8c58e58a95db",
                                                "sense_id": "2bf4a894-f0f3-3123-ab4b-e58ca43f2b60",
                                                "text": "„Der überwiegende Teil der Schoko-Hasen, rund 107 Millionen Stück, verbleiben in Deutschland und erfreuen kleine und große Genießer zum Osterfest.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ffdd5ab1-db3d-4c89-9c7d-b651eca47a94",
                        "source_entry_id": "9c82c3f0-94e4-37bf-ab10-4e2040d32c0e",
                        "source_sense_id": "ea7dd986-bf53-3930-af6e-e2eac3297da8",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person who takes particular pleasure in fine food and drink",
                        "target_lang_word": "Feinschmecker",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Feinschmecker",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af897dc3-a03b-395a-abdd-e7b4c44f7ff7",
                                        "entry_id": "0b48cff2-6476-36c4-99ff-11734a3e61ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Mensch mit einem verwöhnten und/oder anspruchsvollen Geschmack und einem ausgeprägten Sinn für feine Speisen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9d8eb7a9-4abc-4f6c-bf06-e7d32ccec5fb",
                                                "sense_id": "af897dc3-a03b-395a-abdd-e7b4c44f7ff7",
                                                "text": "„In keiner anderen deutschen Stadt gibt es so viele chinesische Restaurants wie in Berlin. Als Ende der 20er Jahre bereits das erste in der Hauptstadt eröffnete, bejubelten die Feinschmecker die \"neue, kulinarische Weltoffenheit\" der Metropole.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba16db79-b1b4-48da-8c4b-379eef1fc0f5",
                                                "sense_id": "af897dc3-a03b-395a-abdd-e7b4c44f7ff7",
                                                "text": "„Er war ein schöner Mann, ein Feinschmecker und Schlemmer und sehr geistreich.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
